	This happened to me once, too. That's how I found out that if enough
monsters attack a blue jelly (i.e. its hit points get high enough) it'll split
in two!
	There were something like two dozen hill orcs on the level. They all
came and attacked me, and all died of hypothermia. And my hit points went up
high enough that I split into *two* blue jellies named Zach. Eventually I re-
turned to human form, and the other blue jelly remained as my pet (with my
name retained). Very amusing, indeed. (I eventually went down deeper, came
back up, and found that my blue jelly had gone wild -- so I killed it.)

